      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## AI Empire · Dataset Maker (FireRed Image Edit 1.1)\n\n**How to use**\n1. Load your influencer's face in **Your face** (clear, front-facing, even light).\n2. In **Dataset Presets**: set the trigger word (e.g. `zvx woman`) and describe what must stay the same in *extra_description* (e.g. `with long straight dark brown hair, brown eyes`).\n3. First run: **how_many = 3**. If they look like her, set it to 40.\n4. Press **Run**. Images + matching .txt captions are saved to `output/datasets/<name>/`, plus a `.zip`.\n\n**Settings**\n- Model: **FireRed Image Edit 1.1** (Apache 2.0), built for identity consistency. The file is 41 GB (bf16).\n- 80 GB GPU (A100/H100): leave UNet weight_dtype = default. 48 GB GPU (A6000/A40/L40S): set weight_dtype = **fp8_e4m3fn**.\n- 8 steps, CFG 1, euler / simple (Lightning LoRA). Max quality: bypass the LoRA (Ctrl+B) and use 40 steps, CFG 4.\n\n**Models**\n- diffusion_models: [FireRed-Image-Edit-1.1-transformer.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/FireRedTeam/FireRed-Image-Edit-1.1-ComfyUI/resolve/main/FireRed-Image-Edit-1.1-transformer.safetensors)\n- loras: [FireRed-Image-Edit-1.1-Lightning-8steps-v1.2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/FireRedTeam/FireRed-Image-Edit-1.1-ComfyUI/resolve/main/FireRed-Image-Edit-1.1-Lightning-8steps-v1.2.safetensors)\n- text_encoders: [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n- vae: [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)"
      ],
      "title": "READ ME"
    }
